{"vid":"AOKbEhnYMOQ","source":"AOKbEhnYMOQ.en-orig.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0,"txt":"We knew that if we're going to bring in"},{"t":1.4,"txt":"a standardized curriculum for welding,"},{"t":3.7,"txt":"it really needed to be AWS."},{"t":9.8,"txt":"When you start talking about a standard,"},{"t":11.6,"txt":"if the industry doesn't know them, then"},{"t":13.1,"txt":"it doesn't really make sense."},{"t":14.4,"txt":">> So, I think that the Fundamentals of"},{"t":15.8,"txt":"Welding Curriculum is really providing a"},{"t":18.2,"txt":"good strong base that's going to develop"},{"t":20.6,"txt":"future welders for the industry."},{"t":27,"txt":">> When we chose a Fundamentals of Welding"},{"t":29.3,"txt":"Curriculum, it was primarily because of"},{"t":31.5,"txt":"its comprehensive content, its"},{"t":33.5,"txt":"connection with the Sense American"},{"t":35.8,"txt":"Welding Society Sense program, as well"},{"t":38.1,"txt":"as covering everything that our state"},{"t":40.4,"txt":"requires in the classroom. It's pretty"},{"t":42.7,"txt":"much a all-in-one package."},{"t":44.6,"txt":">> You want kids to leave here with what we"},{"t":46,"txt":"call industry recognized credentials. If"},{"t":48.1,"txt":"kids are ready to go on internships, if"},{"t":49.8,"txt":"kids are ready to take the assessments,"},{"t":51.7,"txt":"kids are ready to earn college credit,"},{"t":53.8,"txt":"and we have a really solid curriculum"},{"t":55.4,"txt":"that facilitates that, that's a win-win"},{"t":57.2,"txt":"for everybody."},{"t":58,"txt":">> They've got promotional posters that"},{"t":59.7,"txt":"come with the curriculum. You have"},{"t":61.4,"txt":"options to take textbooks, lab manuals,"},{"t":63.8,"txt":"online access to the modules, online"},{"t":66.4,"txt":"access to the text. It just includes"},{"t":68.9,"txt":"about everything, including lesson plans"},{"t":71.4,"txt":"that an instructor needs to base the"},{"t":73.4,"txt":"program off of."},{"t":74.4,"txt":">> The depth that you get from AWS is"},{"t":77,"txt":"pretty hard to beat with just like"},{"t":78.3,"txt":"learning on your own, which I came into"},{"t":80.6,"txt":"this program without any experience, and"},{"t":82.7,"txt":"it's really clear and concise, but it"},{"t":84.9,"txt":"also brings out all the little tiny"},{"t":87.1,"txt":"details that you have to learn and you"},{"t":88.8,"txt":"have to know."},{"t":89.4,"txt":">> The Fundamentals of Welding Curriculum"},{"t":90.9,"txt":"provide a good outline for a CTE"},{"t":93.9,"txt":"instructor who's typically straight out"},{"t":96.4,"txt":"of industry. They don't have a lot of"},{"t":98.5,"txt":"educational experience, so it gives them"},{"t":100.7,"txt":"a good outline to run the class and"},{"t":103.8,"txt":"resource for them to keep track. Having"},{"t":105.9,"txt":"got my CWI through the American Welding"},{"t":107.8,"txt":"Society myself, I can see connection"},{"t":110.6,"txt":"with a lot of the inspection and review"},{"t":113.8,"txt":"of the weld that the student's going to"},{"t":115.8,"txt":"do in the curriculum, which gives them a"},{"t":117.8,"txt":"really strong basis."},{"t":119.5,"txt":">> I think the biggest benefit is when kids"},{"t":121.4,"txt":"learn through this program, they know"},{"t":123.4,"txt":"they're getting fundamental learning"},{"t":125.1,"txt":"that will apply across any job they"},{"t":126.9,"txt":"would do in the welding industry."},{"t":128.5,"txt":">> We're going to have some students that"},{"t":130.5,"txt":"connect with the reading presentation in"},{"t":134,"txt":"a PowerPoint, and then students that are"},{"t":136.7,"txt":"going to connect in the shop with a"},{"t":138.6,"txt":"hands-on mode. It helps each one of"},{"t":141.2,"txt":"those for a instructor to have different"},{"t":143.6,"txt":"modes of instruction and be sure that"},{"t":146.5,"txt":"they're communicating or connecting with"},{"t":148.3,"txt":"each student's different learning style."},{"t":150.3,"txt":">> I think the videos were the most"},{"t":151.6,"txt":"helpful, having it more hands-on and"},{"t":153.8,"txt":"showing me what the right thing was."},{"t":155.8,"txt":">> With the videos, um you can learn about"},{"t":158.6,"txt":"uh the techniques and what to look for,"},{"t":160.8,"txt":"and then you go do it hands-on and um"},{"t":162.7,"txt":"you know to expect and look for."},{"t":164.4,"txt":">> Regardless of what the students going to"},{"t":166.1,"txt":"go into, whether it be a manufacturing"},{"t":168.3,"txt":"situation, could be pipeline work,"},{"t":170.9,"txt":"whatever, they've got the basic elements"},{"t":173.8,"txt":"that gets them ready for entry-level"},{"t":176.1,"txt":"position."},{"t":176.7,"txt":">> AWS sponsored curriculum was a"},{"t":178.6,"txt":"no-brainer for us because it would hit a"},{"t":180,"txt":"standard, but also would um provide kind"},{"t":182.5,"txt":"of that broad framework that we were"},{"t":183.9,"txt":"looking for, so that when kids left"},{"t":185.5,"txt":"here, they had the skills necessary, but"},{"t":187.5,"txt":"also had the knowledge."}],"words":[{"t":0,"w":"We"},{"t":0.16,"w":"knew"},{"t":0.32,"w":"that"},{"t":0.44,"w":"if"},{"t":0.56,"w":"we're"},{"t":0.68,"w":"going"},{"t":0.88,"w":"to"},{"t":0.96,"w":"bring"},{"t":1.16,"w":"in"},{"t":1.36,"w":"a"},{"t":2.12,"w":"standardized"},{"t":2.76,"w":"curriculum"},{"t":3.12,"w":"for"},{"t":3.28,"w":"welding,"},{"t":3.68,"w":"it"},{"t":3.84,"w":"really"},{"t":4.12,"w":"needed"},{"t":4.36,"w":"to"},{"t":4.4,"w":"be"},{"t":4.6,"w":"AWS."},{"t":9.8,"w":"When"},{"t":9.96,"w":"you"},{"t":10.04,"w":"start"},{"t":10.32,"w":"talking"},{"t":10.6,"w":"about"},{"t":10.84,"w":"a"},{"t":10.88,"w":"standard,"},{"t":11.64,"w":"if"},{"t":11.8,"w":"the"},{"t":11.88,"w":"industry"},{"t":12.24,"w":"doesn't"},{"t":12.52,"w":"know"},{"t":12.72,"w":"them,"},{"t":13,"w":"then"},{"t":13.12,"w":"it"},{"t":13.24,"w":"doesn't"},{"t":13.52,"w":"really"},{"t":13.72,"w":"make"},{"t":13.88,"w":"sense."},{"t":14.4,"w":">>"},{"t":